'' Array slices (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0003): TKO1069, an array of two dimensions; TKO1070, a
'' source that is no array or span (a string names '[lo to hi]'); TKO1071, constant bounds
'' outside a fixed array's or a span's; TKO1072, a span given two indices; TKO1074, an array or
'' a span sliced with '[ ]'; TKO1052, a const span where a mutable one is wanted. A write
'' through a const span is TKO0617; rebinding one is not. 'f(4 to 3)' is empty and legal, and
'' a dynamic array's bounds are not known until run time.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/array-slices.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(25,3): error TKO0617
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(7,10): error TKO1069: 'g' cannot be sliced: it has 2 dimensions; only a one-dimensional array can
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(8,10): error TKO1070: 's' cannot be sliced with '( )': it is not an array or a span -- a string is sliced with '[lo to hi]'
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(9,14): error TKO1070: 'twice' cannot be sliced with '( )': it is not an array or a span
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(10,10): error TKO1071: slice 0 to 3 is outside 'f' (1 to 6)
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(11,10): error TKO1071: slice 2 to 7 is outside 'f' (1 to 6)
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(12,10): error TKO1071: slice 5 to 3 is outside 'f' (1 to 6)
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(16,8): error TKO1072: a span takes one index, not 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(17,10): error TKO1074: 'f' is an array or a span: slice it with '( )', as in a(lo to hi)
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(18,10): error TKO1074: 'v' is an array or a span
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(19,10): error TKO1071: slice -1 to 1 is outside 'v' (0 to len - 1)
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(21,33): error TKO1052: a const span( of integer ) cannot convert to a mutable span( of integer )
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slices.tiko(24,6): error TKO1052
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 14
